  "Dollar-Cost Averaging is an investment discipline where you invest fixed cash sums at regular calendar intervals, eliminating the emotional pitfalls of market timing.": "定期定额定期定額 (DCA) 是一种極其反人性的理性投資纪律：在预定的日历週期投入固定金额，彻底根除试圖抄底逃顶的人性情绪弱點。",
